msgid ""
"This lists features or changes merged in master and build in the \"latest\" "
"firmware, but not in a stable or beta release yet. They have passed all test"
" suites and usually have already been flight tested. These items are "
"considered in the broad flight testing stage and test users are encouraged. "
"Eventually, they will released in a beta, then stable release."
msgstr ""
"这里列出了已合并到 master 并在「latest」固件中构建、但尚未包含在稳定版或 beta "
"版中的功能或更改。这些内容已通过所有测试套件，通常已完成飞行测试。这些内容处于广泛飞行测试阶段，欢迎测试用户参与。最终它们将发布在 beta "
"版，再到稳定版。"

